{
  "format": 1,
  "kind": "canonical_json",
  "name": "canonical-json-rejections",
  "description": "Values that cannot be written: fractions, NaN, infinity, integers outside +-(2^53-1) (decimal text), lone surrogates, and nesting beyond 64 ancestors. Fractions are never integral floats (JavaScript cannot tell them from integers).",
